  "timestamp": "20260202_034059",
  "agent": "researcher",
  "action": "success",
  "details": {
    "output": "{\"summary\":\"A state\u2011of\u2011the\u2011art Retrieval\u2011Augmented Generation (RAG) pipeline for ~50,000 documents should combine fine\u2011grained chunking (200\u2011400 tokens with overlap), high\u2011quality embeddings (e.g., OpenAI ada\u2011002, BGE\u2011large, Cohere embed\u2011english\u2011v3), an efficient ANN vector store (FAISS IVF\u2011Flat/HNSW for in\u2011memory, or Milvus/Pinecone/Weaviate/Qdrant for persistence), hybrid dense\u2011plus\u2011BM25 retrieval followed by cross\u2011encoder re\u2011ranking, and production\u2011grade scaling (sharding, GPU\u2011accelerated embedding updates, async batching). Security measures include AES\u2011256 encryption at rest, TLS for transport, RBAC/audit logging, and PII redaction or differential\u2011privacy embeddings. Monitoring of latency, recall@k, and token usage completes the pipeline.\",\"key_facts\":[\"Chunk size of 200\u2011400 tokens with 50\u2011100 token overlap yields better context continuity while keeping vector dimensions manageable\",\"Hierarchical chunking (document \u2192 page \u2192 paragraph \u2192 sentence) enables multi\u2011granularity retrieval for diverse queries\",\"Embedding models with strong MTEB scores such as OpenAI ada\u2011002, Sentence\u2011Transformers BGE\u2011large, and Cohere embed\u2011english\u2011v3 provide high semantic fidelity for English corpora\",\"For 50k docs (\u224838\u202fMB at 768\u2011dim) a RAM\u2011resident ANN index like FAISS IVF\u2011Flat or HNSW is sufficient for low\u2011latency lookup\",\"Persistent vector stores (Milvus, Pinecone, Weaviate, Qdrant) offer IVF\u2011PQ or HNSW, auto\u2011scaling, and built\u2011in security features for production workloads\",\"Hybrid retrieval that first filters with BM25 lexical scores then refines with dense vector similarity improves recall without sacrificing speed\",\"Fetching top\u2011k\u224810\u201120 candidates and re\u2011ranking with a cross\u2011encoder (e.g., mono\u2011T5\u2011xxl) boosts precision for generation inputs\",\"Cache frequently accessed embeddings/chunks and use asynchronous batch embedding to reduce API latency during updates\",\"Scale horizontally by sharding the ANN index across nodes; use GPU\u2011accelerated embedding pipelines for frequent corpus refreshes\",\"Encrypt vector data at rest (AES\u2011256), enforce TLS for all API traffic, and implement role\u2011based access control with audit logging to meet security standards\",\"Apply PII redaction before chunking and optionally employ differential\u2011privacy techniques on embeddings for privacy\u2011sensitive domains\",\"Monitor latency, recall@k, token usage and drift; set alerts to trigger re\u2011indexing or model updates\"],\"sources\":[\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.11401\",\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss\",\"https://milvus.io/docs\",\"https://www.pinecone.io/learn/ann\",\"https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers\",\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/embeddings\",\"https://www.cohere.com/models/embeddings\",\"https://www.langchain.com/docs\",\"https://qdrant.tech/documentation/\",\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/query-dsl-bm25-query.html\",\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.08691\",\"https://cloud.google.com/security/encryption-at-rest\"],\"confidence_level\":\"High\"}"
  }
}
